    <item>
      <title>Swimming</title>
      <link>https://hughandbecky.us/kids/katja/project/skiing/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://hughandbecky.us/kids/katja/project/skiing/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In the summer of 2023 and 2024 I swam with Team Eugene&amp;rsquo;s Mallards. They have three squads I swam on the green squad (beginners) for two main reasons:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;They swam at the pool down the street from my house rather than across town.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Only those who could stay all summer and attend state finals could swim on the competative squad. My path lead to Princeton, New Jersey before summer&amp;rsquo;s end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am looking for the best team fit for pushing my swimming capability. I value a balance of peer-comradery, structured skill building, and attentive (and personalized as needed) coaching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;August 3rd
25 yard backstroke &lt;a href=&#34;https://youtu.be/W5FOWmSdx58&#34;&gt;https://youtu.be/W5FOWmSdx58&lt;/a&gt;
100 yard freestyle &lt;a href=&#34;https://youtu.be/gS-6vFikPTk&#34;&gt;https://youtu.be/gS-6vFikPTk&lt;/a&gt;
25 yard butterfly &lt;a href=&#34;https://youtu.be/R4AOxU7mZg0&#34;&gt;https://youtu.be/R4AOxU7mZg0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;July 12th
25 yard Butterfly &lt;a href=&#34;https://youtu.be/z2f5i0gAhQA&#34;&gt;https://youtu.be/z2f5i0gAhQA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
